          "code": {
            "language": "plaintext",
            "showLineNumbers": false,
            "showMiniMap": false
          },
          "content": "<br/>  \n\n# <a href=\"https://usegalaxy.eu\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 51, 153);\">European Galaxy Server</a>  \n\n<a href=\"https://galaxyproject.org/eu/\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 51, 153);\">Galaxy</a> is an open, web-based platform for data-intensive computational \nresearch that spans beyond the life sciences. It allows researchers without programming experience to run analysis workflows on their data, share their results, and enable others to repeat the same analyses. Galaxy makes science reproducible, facilitates sharing of data and results, and removes the hassle of installing  \nsoftware tools from users.  \n\nThe <a href=\"https://usegalaxy.eu\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 51, 153);\">European Galaxy Server</a> is a de.NBI and an ELIXIR service and part of the <a href=\"https://elixir-europe.org/communities/galaxy\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 51, 153);\">ELIXIR Galaxy community</a>.",
          "mode": "markdown"
        },
